msgstr "Ejemplo de uso de rxcallback::"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:391
msgid "Constants"
msgstr "Constantes"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:393
msgid "Bus-mode constants (``mode`` argument of :meth:`init`):"
msgstr "Constantes de modo de bus (argumento ``mode`` de :meth:`init`):"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:398
msgid ""
"The controller participates normally on the bus -- transmits its own frames "
"and acknowledges valid received frames."
msgstr ""
"El controlador participa con normalidad en el bus -- transmite sus propias "
"tramas y confirma las tramas válidas recibidas."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:404
msgid ""
"Internal loopback mode: the controller is disconnected from the pins and "
"routes transmitted frames straight back to the receive path. Useful for "
"self-tests without a transceiver."
msgstr ""
"Modo de bucle de retorno interno: el controlador se desconecta de los pines "
"y enruta las tramas transmitidas directamente de vuelta a la ruta de "
"recepción. Útil para autodiagnósticos sin un transceptor."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:411
msgid ""
"Listen-only mode: the controller receives frames but never drives the bus "
"(no ACK, no transmissions). Useful for bus sniffing."
msgstr ""
"Modo de solo escucha: el controlador recibe tramas pero nunca excita el bus "
"(sin ACK, sin transmisiones). Útil para la captura de tráfico del bus."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:417
msgid ""
"Combines :data:`SILENT` and :data:`LOOPBACK`: no pin activity and no "
"acknowledgements, with internal loopback of TX into RX."
msgstr ""
"Combina :data:`SILENT` y :data:`LOOPBACK`: sin actividad en los pines y sin "
"confirmaciones, con bucle de retorno interno de TX hacia RX."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:420
msgid "Controller-state constants (returned by :meth:`state`):"
msgstr "Constantes de estado del controlador (devueltas por :meth:`state`):"

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:425
msgid "The controller is completely off and reset."
msgstr "El controlador está completamente apagado y reiniciado."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:430
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Active state (both TEC and REC are "
"less than 96)."
msgstr ""
"El controlador está encendido y en el estado Error Active (tanto TEC como "
"REC son menores que 96)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:436
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Warning state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 96 or greater)."
msgstr ""
"El controlador está encendido y en el estado Error Warning (al menos uno de "
"TEC o REC es 96 o mayor)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:442
msgid ""
"The controller is on and in the Error Passive state (at least one of TEC or "
"REC is 128 or greater)."
msgstr ""
"El controlador está encendido y en el estado Error Passive (al menos uno de "
"TEC o REC es 128 o mayor)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:448
msgid ""
"The controller is on but not participating in bus activity (TEC overflowed "
"beyond 255)."
msgstr ""
"El controlador está encendido pero no participa en la actividad del bus (TEC"
" se desbordó por encima de 255)."

#: ../../library/pyb.CAN.rst:451
msgid ""
"Classic-CAN filter modes (``mode`` argument of :meth:`setfilter` on the "
"OpenMV Cam M4 / M7):"
msgstr ""
"Modos de filtro de CAN clásico (argumento ``mode`` de :meth:`setfilter` en "
"la OpenMV Cam M4 / M7):"

